# Q40 (graph part). Every live concept carries its official wording: rows are concepts with no definition (must be none). Excluded: retired concepts, concepts on implementation hold, and CM-1-1-3-5-3, the intentional business-evidence hold (Step 3c batch 42).
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX core: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/core/>
PREFIX mod: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/>
PREFIX src: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/source/>
PREFIX proc: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/process/>

SELECT ?c WHERE { ?c skos:inScheme mod:core . FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?c skos:definition ?d } FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?c owl:deprecated true } FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?c core:holdStatus ?h } FILTER (?c != proc:CM-1-1-3-5-3) }
